---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import companyData from '../../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
	title="Seasonal Golf Cart Maintenance Checklist | Masters Golf Cars"
	description="Complete seasonal maintenance guide for your golf cart. Spring, summer, fall, and winter tips to keep your cart running smoothly in Central Florida's climate."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
					<a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Blog</a>
					<span class="text-gray-500">/</span>
					<span class="text-gray-400">Maintenance</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Seasonal Golf Cart Maintenance Checklist</h1>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-300">
					<span>By Masters Golf Cars</span>
					<span>|</span>
					<time datetime="2025-01-08">January 8, 2025</time>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Article Content -->
	<article class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<!-- Featured Image -->
				<div class="mb-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
					<img
						src="/images/golf cart repair page/05-08-2025-14-31-52_55.webp"
						alt="Golf cart maintenance service"
						class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover"
					/>
				</div>

				<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						Your golf cart needs care to run well and stay safe. In Central Florida, the weather can be hard on carts. Hot summers, rainy days, and humid air all take a toll. Masters Golf Cars has been fixing Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, and Advanced EV carts in Ocala, The Villages, and Marion County since 1999. Use this simple guide to keep your cart in great shape all year.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Spring Maintenance</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Spring in Marion County and Sumter County means warmer days. People start using their carts more. Time to get your cart ready for busy season. Maybe you want to drive to the Market of Marion on the weekends or head to Spanish Springs for live music.
					</p>

					<div class="bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-brand-green rounded-r-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Spring To-Do List</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check batteries</strong> - Look at water levels in lead-acid batteries, clean off any white stuff on the posts, test how much power they hold</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Fill tires</strong> - Add air to reach 18-22 PSI like the maker says</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Test brakes</strong> - Make sure they grab well and hold on hills like the ones in Golden Ocala</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check all lights</strong> - Try headlights, taillights, and turn signals</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Wash your cart</strong> - Clean outside and inside, wipe down seats</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Add grease</strong> - Oil all moving parts like steering and springs</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Summer Maintenance</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Florida summers are tough on golf carts. It gets really hot in Ocala and The Villages. Afternoon storms hit almost every day. The air is thick with water. Your cart needs extra care in June, July, and August.
					</p>

					<div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 rounded-r-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Summer To-Do List</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check battery water EVERY WEEK</strong> - Heat makes water dry up fast in lead-acid batteries</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Watch tire air</strong> - Hot roads make tires puff up, so lower the air a bit</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Cover when parked</strong> - Use a cover that lets air through to stop sun damage</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Protect your seats</strong> - Put UV spray on vinyl so it does not crack</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Look at wires</strong> - Humid air causes rust on metal parts and wire ends</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Test air conditioning</strong> - If your cart has A/C, make sure cold air comes out</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check belts</strong> - (Gas carts) Look for cracks from heat</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Fall Maintenance</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Fall is the best time for a full checkup. The busy winter season is coming. Family will visit for the holidays. You want your cart ready for trips to the World Equestrian Center in Ocala or HITS horse shows. Get it done now before you get busy.
					</p>

					<div class="bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-400 rounded-r-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Fall To-Do List</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Get a pro checkup</strong> - Bring your cart to <a href="/schedule-golf-cart-service" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Masters Golf Cars</a> for a full look-over</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Test battery power</strong> - Find out if you need new batteries before winter</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check brake pads</strong> - Get new ones if they are too thin</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Look at tire wear</strong> - Bumpy wear means your wheels need to line up</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Change oil</strong> - (Gas carts) Fresh oil before winter</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Clean windshield</strong> - Check for cracks before cool weather comes</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Winter Maintenance</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Florida winters are mild but still matter. Cool air affects batteries. Many snowbirds come to The Villages and OTOW, so cart paths get busy. Some folks travel north and leave their carts at home. Here is what to do either way.
					</p>

					<div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 rounded-r-xl p-6 mb-8">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Winter To-Do List</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Charge often</strong> - Cold makes batteries weaker, so plug in more</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Store the right way</strong> - If you leave, fill batteries and unplug the black wire</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Add fuel saver</strong> - (Gas carts) Put in gas stabilizer if storing for weeks</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check rain cover</strong> - Test zippers and snaps on your weather shield</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Test heater</strong> - If you have a heater, try it before a cold snap</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
								</svg>
								<span><strong>Check all lights</strong> - Days are short, so you need good lights for evening trips to Lake Sumter Landing</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Quick Monthly Checks</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						No matter what time of year, do these quick checks every month. They only take a few minutes:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Tire air</strong> - Use a gauge to check in 2 minutes</li>
						<li><strong>Battery posts</strong> - Look for white crusty stuff or loose wires</li>
						<li><strong>Brakes</strong> - Press the pedal and see how it feels</li>
						<li><strong>Steering</strong> - Check for loose feel or weird sounds</li>
						<li><strong>Lights and blinkers</strong> - Quick look to see they all work</li>
						<li><strong>Mirrors</strong> - Make sure they point the right way and stay put</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">When to Call Masters Golf Cars</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Some things you can do at home. Other things need a pro. Bring your cart to our shop on US-441 in Belleview if you notice:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Strange sounds</strong> - Grinding, squeaking, or knocking is not normal</li>
						<li><strong>Less distance</strong> - If your cart does not go as far on a charge, something is wrong</li>
						<li><strong>Electric problems</strong> - Lights that blink or power that comes and goes</li>
						<li><strong>Brake trouble</strong> - Mushy pedal, pulling to one side, or grinding sounds</li>
						<li><strong>Motor issues</strong> - Less power, too much heat, or odd noises</li>
						<li><strong>Old batteries</strong> - Think about a <a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">lithium battery upgrade</a></li>
					</ul>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						<a href="/golf-cart-repairs" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Masters Golf Cars</a> offers full repair and service. We fix most carts in one day. We can even pick up and drop off your cart if you live in Ocala Palms, Oak Run, OTOW, or The Villages.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- CTA Section -->
				<div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Need Help With Your Cart?</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
						Book a service visit or stop by our shop on US-441 in Belleview. Masters Golf Cars has helped folks in Marion County and Sumter County for over 25 years.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
						<a
							href="/schedule-golf-cart-service"
							class="bg-brand-green text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition"
						>
							Schedule Service
						</a>
						<a
							href={companyData.contact.phoneLink}
							class="bg-white text-gray-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition"
						>
							Call {companyData.contact.phone}
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Author Bio -->
				<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<img
							src="/images/logos/MastersGolfCarsLogo.png"
							alt="Masters Golf Cars"
							class="w-16 h-16 object-contain"
						/>
						<div>
							<p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Masters Golf Cars</p>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
								Masters Golf Cars has served Central Florida since 1999. We sell, fix, and rent golf carts in The Villages, Ocala, Belleview, and all of Marion and Sumter County.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Related Posts -->
				<div class="mt-12">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Related Articles</h3>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
						<a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Lithium Battery Conversion: Everything You Need to Know</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Upgrade your golf cart with lithium batteries for better range and zero maintenance.</p>
						</a>
						<a href="/blog/electric-vs-gas-golf-carts" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Electric vs Gas Golf Carts: Which Is Right for You?</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Compare the maintenance requirements of electric and gas golf carts.</p>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
